#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:10
msgid "Optimize Sparse Attention in FFA"
msgstr "在 FFA 中优化 Sparse Attention"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:12
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Sparse attention has become an important technique for accelerating long-"
"context training and inference. By letting each query attend to only a "
"subset of key/value tokens, sparse attention substantially reduces the "
"compute cost of standard softmax attention. Recent architectures such as "
"DeepSeek Sparse Attention (`DSA`) "
"{cite}`deepseekai2025deepseekv32pushingfrontieropen_sparse_attn` have "
"demonstrated the effectiveness of dynamically selected sparse attention. "
"However, turning theoretical FLOP reductions into actual GPU speedups "
"remains challenging. Unlike dense FlashAttention, sparse attention "
"introduces irregular memory accesses and small matrix multiplications "
"that can under-utilize modern Tensor Cores. Efficient execution requires "
"careful design of the sparse representation, work partitioning, and "
"memory pipeline. In this post, we present the design and implementation "
"of `IndexSparse Attention` in `MagiAttention`, and discuss how we "
"optimize its forward, backward, and streaming top-{math}`k` kernels for "
"NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs with CuTe DSL."
msgstr ""
"稀疏注意力已成为加速长上下文训练与推理的一项重要技术。通过让每个查询仅关注一部分键/值 token，稀疏注意力显著降低了标准 softmax 注意力的计算成本。近期诸如 DeepSeek Sparse Attention（`DSA`）{cite}`deepseekai2025deepseekv32pushingfrontieropen_sparse_attn` 等架构已经证明了动态选择稀疏注意力的有效性。然而，将 FLOPs 的理论减少转化为实际的 GPU 加速仍然具有挑战性。与稠密 FlashAttention 不同，稀疏注意力会引入不规则的内存访问和小矩阵乘法，可能无法充分利用现代 Tensor Core。高效执行需要周密设计稀疏表示、任务划分和内存流水线。在这篇文章中，我们介绍 `MagiAttention` 中的 `IndexSparse Attention` 设计与实现，并讨论我们如何使用 CuTe DSL 为 NVIDIA Blackwell GPU 优化其前向、反向与流式 top-{math}`k` 算子。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:17
msgid "Sparse Patterns and Bottlenecks"
msgstr "稀疏模式与性能瓶颈"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Early sparse attention designs fix the attended subset by position — such"
" as sliding windows, strided patterns, and global or sink tokens "
"{cite}`child2019generatinglongsequencessparse_sparse_attn,beltagy2020longformerlongdocumenttransformer_sparse_attn,zaheer2021bigbirdtransformerslonger_sparse_attn`."
" Recent trainable mechanisms instead select keys dynamically from content"
" in two stages: a lightweight indexer scores the prefix to pick a fixed "
"budget of keys per query, and main attention runs exact softmax attention"
" over the selected keys only. Mainstream designs follow two granularity "
"choices: **token-wise** `DSA` "
"{cite}`deepseekai2025deepseekv32pushingfrontieropen_sparse_attn` picks "
"{math}`k = 2048` individual tokens ({math}`B_k = 1`) on top of `MLA` in "
"MQA mode, where all 128 query heads of one token share a single 512-dim "
"latent KV vector (plus 64-dim RoPE) and one index list; **block-wise** "
"`NSA` {cite}`yuan2025nativesparseattentionhardwarealigned_sparse_attn`, "
"`MoBA` {cite}`lu2025mobamixtureblockattention_sparse_attn`, and `MSA` "
"{cite}`lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn` target standard 128-dim"
" `GQA` by selecting contiguous KV blocks per group (or, as in `QSA` "
"{cite}`qwenteam2026qwen38next_sparse_attn`, pooling every 4 keys into "
"micro-blocks before scoring to cut the indexer's {math}`O(N^2)` cost)."
msgstr ""
"早期稀疏注意力方案按位置规定可见集合，例如滑动窗口、固定步长以及全局或 sink token {cite}`child2019generatinglongsequencessparse_sparse_attn,beltagy2020longformerlongdocumenttransformer_sparse_attn,zaheer2021bigbirdtransformerslonger_sparse_attn`。近期的可训练稀疏机制改为根据内容分两步动态筛选：先由轻量级 indexer 对历史前缀打分，为每个 query 选出固定预算的 key；主分支仅在选中的 key 上执行精确的 softmax attention。主流方案按选择粒度分为两类：**按单 token 选择**的 `DSA` {cite}`deepseekai2025deepseekv32pushingfrontieropen_sparse_attn` 建立在 `MLA` 的 MQA 模式之上，每个 query token 挑选 {math}`k = 2048` 个独立 token（{math}`B_k = 1`），同一个 token 的 128 个 query head 共用唯一一条 512 维 latent KV 向量（外加 64 维 RoPE）和同一份索引列表；**按块选择**的 `NSA` {cite}`yuan2025nativesparseattentionhardwarealigned_sparse_attn`、`MoBA` {cite}`lu2025mobamixtureblockattention_sparse_attn` 与 `MSA` {cite}`lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn` 面向标准 128 维 `GQA`，按组选择连续的整块 KV（或如 `QSA` {cite}`qwenteam2026qwen38next_sparse_attn` 在打分前将每 4 个 key 池化为微块以削减 indexer 自身的 {math}`O(N^2)` 开销）。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Turning dynamic sparsity into real training speedups requires resolving "
"three hardware bottlenecks "
"{cite}`yan2026fsaalternativeefficientimplementation_sparse_attn,lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn`:"
msgstr ""
"要把动态稀疏转化为训练阶段的真实加速，必须解决三个执行瓶颈 {cite}`yan2026fsaalternativeefficientimplementation_sparse_attn,lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn`："

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Tensor Core utilization.** On Blackwell, a single-CTA BF16 "
"`tcgen05.mma` requires {math}`M = 64` or 128 rows. Under standard `GQA`, "
"one query token has only {math}`G = H_q / H_{kv}` heads (typically 4 to "
"16), so processing tokens one by one leaves most of {math}`M` as wasted "
"padding."
msgstr ""
"**Tensor Core 利用率。** Blackwell 上单 CTA 的 BF16 `tcgen05.mma` 要求 {math}`M = 64` 或 128 行。标准 `GQA` 中单个 query token 在同组内只有 {math}`G = H_q / H_{kv}` 个 head（通常为 4 到 16），逐个 token 独立计算会让 {math}`M` 维的大部分行沦为空算的 padding。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**K/V reuse and loop order.** Loading K/V independently per query in a "
"`Q-outer` loop gives an arithmetic intensity of only {math}`\\approx G` "
"{cite}`lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn`. Grouping work by KV "
"block (`KV-outer`, arithmetic intensity {math}`\\approx \\frac{2}{3} "
"B_k`) works well for large blocks like `MSA` ({math}`B_k = 128`), whereas"
" at single-token granularity ({math}`B_k = 1`), inverting indices over "
"{math}`N` tokens and splitting sink-token hotspots costs more than "
"attention itself."
msgstr ""
"**K/V 复用与循环顺序。** 在 `Q-outer` 循环下每个 query 各自读取 K/V，算术强度只有 {math}`\\approx G` {cite}`lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn`。按 KV 块分组的 `KV-outer`（算术强度 {math}`\\approx \\frac{2}{3} B_k`）适合 `MSA` 这类大尺寸块（{math}`B_k = 128`），而在单 token 粒度（{math}`B_k = 1`）下，对 {math}`N` 个独立位置建反向索引并切分 sink 热点的开销会超过 attention 计算本身。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:20
msgid ""
"**`head_dim` vs. backward on-chip memory.** While `MLA`'s 512 head "
"dimension boosts forward arithmetic intensity, backward must "
"simultaneously hold `Q`, `K`, `V`, `dO`, intermediate scores, and "
"`dQ`/`dK`/`dV` accumulators in `TMEM` (512 columns per SM on Blackwell) "
"and `SMEM`. An oversized `head_dim` exhausts `TMEM` and `SMEM`, shrinking"
" tile sizes or pipeline depth and preventing backward from reaching high "
"TFLOPS."
msgstr ""
"**`head_dim` 与反向片上存储。** `MLA` 的 512 维大 `head_dim` 虽然提高了前向的计算密度，但训练反向需要同时在 `TMEM`（Blackwell 上每个 SM 仅 512 列）和 `SMEM` 中容纳 `Q`、`K`、`V`、`dO`、中间分数与 `dQ`/`dK`/`dV` 累加器。过大的 `head_dim` 会占满 `TMEM` 和 `SMEM`，迫使缩窄 tile 尺寸或减少流水级数，反向无法打出高 TFLOPS。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:23
msgid "IndexSparse Attention"
msgstr "IndexSparse Attention"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Shared indexing.** In `FFA`, [AttnSlice](./magi_attn.md#attnslice-"
"representation) represents masks as contiguous query–key rectangles, so "
"token-wise selection degenerates into {math}`k` width-1 slices per query."
" We therefore design **IndexSparse** in the CuTeDSL backend of `FFA` "
"(`SM100` forward and backward, plus `SM120` forward), paired with a "
"streaming top-{math}`k` operator `cutedsl_topk_stream`. To support token-"
"level sparsity on standard `head_dim = 128` across both `MQA` and `GQA`, "
"`IndexSparse` shares one index row across the {math}`G` query heads of a "
"KV group and `q_block_size` consecutive query tokens such that "
"`q_block_size * G = 128` (`q_block_size = 1` for `MQA-128`, `q_block_size"
" = 16` for `8:1 GQA`). Every 128-row Q tile then attends to the exact "
"same K/V rows in a single `Q-outer` pass — filling Tensor Cores and "
"reusing K/V across all 128 rows without union-mask waste. Selections are "
"passed as an `int32` tensor `index_sparse_indices` of shape "
"`(ceil(total_q / q_block_size), num_heads_kv, topk)`, with valid global "
"indices at the front and `-1` padding at the tail when fewer than "
"{math}`k` keys are visible."
msgstr ""
"**共享索引。** `FFA` 原有的 [AttnSlice](./magi_attn.md#attnslice-representation) 用连续矩形表示 mask，按单 token 选择会让每个 query 退化出 {math}`k` 个宽度为 1 的切片。为此，我们在 `FFA` 的 CuTeDSL backend 中设计了 **IndexSparse**（包含 `SM100` 的前向与反向，以及 `SM120` 的前向），并配套实现了流式 top-{math}`k` 算子 `cutedsl_topk_stream`。为了在标准 `head_dim = 128` 上同时覆盖 `MQA` 与 `GQA`，`IndexSparse` 让同一个 KV 组内的 {math}`G` 个 query head 与连续 `q_block_size` 个 query token 共用同一行索引，满足 `q_block_size * G = 128`（`MQA-128` 取 `q_block_size = 1`，`8:1 GQA` 取 `q_block_size = 16`）。这样每个 128 行 Q tile 在单遍 `Q-outer` 循环内读取完全一致的 K/V 行——既填满了 Tensor Core，又在 tile 内全部 128 行间复用了 K/V，也没有相邻 token 取并集带来的无效计算。选中位置通过形状为 `(ceil(total_q / q_block_size), num_heads_kv, topk)` 的 `int32` 张量 `index_sparse_indices` 传入；可见 key 不足 {math}`k` 个时，有效全局下标排在行首、行尾补 `-1`。"

