#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:47
msgid ""
"`ffa_bwd_sm100_index` also accepts an optional `dlse` gradient tensor so "
"an auxiliary KL loss on the indexer can backpropagate through `lse` "
"directly."
msgstr "`ffa_bwd_sm100_index` 还支持传入可选的 `dlse` 梯度张量，使 indexer 上的辅助 KL 损失可以直接经由 `lse` 传回梯度。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:50
msgid "Kernel Design"
msgstr "Kernel 设计"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Forward pass.** Each CTA owns one 128-row Q tile, loads Q contiguously,"
" gathers the {math}`k` scattered K/V rows asynchronously, and reduces "
"`out` and `lse` on chip with online softmax. Early causal positions with "
"fewer than {math}`k` visible keys carry `-1` tail padding that must be "
"masked to {math}`-\\infty`. Because valid indices sit at the front and "
"`-1` appears only at the tail, the inner loop traverses K/V tiles **in "
"reverse order from last to first**: partially padded tail tiles are "
"handled up front, and the remaining tiles run without bounds checks or "
"score masking (`assume_valid_ids=True` removes the check entirely at "
"compile time when all rows are full)."
msgstr ""
"**前向计算。** 每个 CTA 负责一个 128 行 Q tile，连续加载 Q，异步 gather 选中的 {math}`k` 行离散 K/V，通过 online softmax 在片上直接归约出 `out` 和 `lse`。因果序列开头可见 key 不足 {math}`k` 个的位置带有 `-1` 尾部填充，需要在 softmax 前置为 {math}`-\\infty`。由于有效下标排在行首、`-1` 只出现在行尾，内层循环**从最后一个 K/V tile 往前逆序遍历**：先处理完尾部可能带填充的 tile，后续迭代全程不再做越界判断或分数 mask（每行都满 `topk` 个有效下标时，传入 `assume_valid_ids=True` 可在编译期彻底去掉该检查）。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Backward pass.** `ffa_bwd_sm100_index` stays `Q-outer` as well to avoid"
" per-step single-token index inversion and sink-token load skew: `dQ` "
"accumulates on chip and writes back once, while scattered FP32 `dK`/`dV` "
"updates are staged as full rows in shared memory and accumulated via "
"asynchronous whole-row `TMA` `reduce.add`. As context length grows, the "
"random K/V and `dK`/`dV` working set crosses the GPU's L2 capacity "
"{math}`L_2`. In the L2-miss latency window {math}`(0.5\\, L_2,\\, 4\\, "
"L_2]`, the kernel automatically overlaps V gathers with the next tile's K"
" fetch (`gather_v_async`) to double in-flight reads; past {math}`2\\, "
"L_2` where DRAM bandwidth saturates, it switches to L2-sized multi-pass "
"execution (`num_k_passes`), bucket-sorting each index row into "
"{math}`\\sim 0.8\\, L_2` KV chunks so every pass's random reads and "
"reductions stay inside L2."
msgstr ""
"**反向计算。** `ffa_bwd_sm100_index` 同样保持 `Q-outer`，省去每步反转单 token 索引的开销并避开 sink token 的负载悬殊：`dQ` 在片上累加完一次写回，离散的 FP32 `dK`/`dV` 在 shared memory 凑齐整行后通过异步 `TMA` `reduce.add` 整行累加。随着上下文变长，随机读写跨越的 K/V 与 `dK`/`dV` 工作集逐步超出 GPU 的 L2 容量 {math}`L_2`。在 {math}`(0.5\\, L_2,\\, 4\\, L_2]` 的 L2 未命中延迟区间内，kernel 自动将 V 的异步 gather 与下一轮 K 的读取重叠（`gather_v_async`），使在途随机读翻倍以掩盖延迟；超过 {math}`2\\, L_2` 导致 DRAM 带宽饱和后，自动切入按 L2 分块的多遍模式（`num_k_passes`），先把每行索引按约 {math}`0.8\\, L_2` 宽的 KV 区间分桶归类，再按区间逐遍运行，让每一遍的随机读取和归约都收敛在 L2 内。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:56
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"**Streaming Top-K (`cutedsl_topk_stream`).** Since softmax is monotonic, "
"top-{math}`k` runs directly on raw BF16/FP16 indexer scores and outputs "
"ascending indices {cite}`lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn`. At "
"long contexts, {math}`k / N` is tiny (over 99% of entries at {math}`k = "
"2048, N = 256\\text{K}` sit below the threshold), yet multi-pass radix "
"select re-reads the full row from HBM every pass. `cutedsl_topk_stream` "
"({math}`N \\le 2^{21}, k \\le 10240`) assigns one CTA per row to stream "
"HBM **only once** in the common case: it first samples strided 64-element"
" blocks across `[0, end)` to estimate a conservative lower-bound "
"threshold on chip, then streams the row once with TMA to filter survivors"
" into an on-chip buffer for a final 2-byte radix select. Mid-scan "
"compaction on ties and a {math}`-\\infty` rescan when survivors fall "
"short of {math}`k` guarantee exact results."
msgstr ""
"**流式 Top-K（`cutedsl_topk_stream`）。** 由于 softmax 单调保序，top-{math}`k` 直接作用于原始 BF16/FP16 分数并按升序输出下标 {cite}`lai2026minimaxsparseattention_sparse_attn`。长上下文下 {math}`k / N` 极小（例如 {math}`k = 2048, N = 256\\text{K}` 时超过 99% 的分数低于阈值），而常规多遍 radix select 每轮都要从 HBM 重读整行。`cutedsl_topk_stream`（{math}`N \\le 2^{21}, k \\le 10240`）让单个 CTA 独立负责一整行，常见情况下**只流式读取一次 HBM**：先在有效区间 `[0, end)` 上隔段抽取 64 元素小块，在片上估出留有余量的下界阈值；再用 TMA 单遍流式扫描整行，将跨过门槛的候选滤入片上缓冲区做最终的两字节 radix select。遇到成片相等分数时中途就地裁剪、候选不足 {math}`k` 个时降为 {math}`-\\infty` 补扫一遍，保证结果严格精确。"

